{"id":"e12a91afc1e6fbc6","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-monodualcount.md","title":"Output bound for positive DNF dualization","display":"thm-monodualcount — Output bound for positive DNF dualization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-monodualcount","aliases":["27-thm-monodualcount"],"display":"thm-monodualcount — Output bound for positive DNF dualization","depends_on":["[[27-df-monodnf]]","[[27-df-dual]]","[[27-df-piset]]","[[27-thm-dualtransversal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-monodualcount"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-monodualcount</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-monodualcount — Output bound for positive DNF dualization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"814b17f1550bcf38\" href=\"?note=814b17f1550bcf38\" title=\"27-df-monodnf\">27-df-monodnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"753698ebb6dab618\" href=\"?note=753698ebb6dab618\" title=\"27-thm-dualtransversal\">27-thm-dualtransversal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dual}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Dual}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"814b17f1550bcf38\" href=\"?note=814b17f1550bcf38\" title=\"27-df-monodnf\">27-df-monodnf</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b491e41297256b44\" href=\"?note=b491e41297256b44\" title=\"27-df-dual\">27-df-dual</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n\\;\\left(|\\mathrm{PI}(\\mathrm{Dual}_n(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)))|\\le n^{|D|}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n\\;\\left(|\\mathrm{PI}(\\mathrm{Dual}_n(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)))|\\le n^{|D|}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地组合计数推论。来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §4.1.2, Theorem 4.7; §4.2.1, Theorem 4.19，印刷页 170;177，PDF 第 194;201 页（从 1 计数）。 素对偶项是输入文字集族的极小 transversal。每个极小 transversal 可由每条边各选一个元素得到：每个元素有一条私有边，否则可以删除。选择的像至多 n^{|D|} 种。空输入 D 的唯一极小 transversal 是空集；含空项时没有 transversal。显式 n&gt;0 避免把 0^0 约定隐藏在原公式中。此为输出大小界，不是运行时间定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-monodnf","status":"resolved","id":"814b17f1550bcf38","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-monodnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dual","status":"resolved","id":"b491e41297256b44","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dual]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-dualtransversal","status":"resolved","id":"753698ebb6dab618","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-dualtransversal]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-monodnf","status":"resolved","id":"814b17f1550bcf38","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n$, $\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined in [[27-df-monodnf]], [[27-df-dual]] and [[27-df-piset]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dual","status":"resolved","id":"b491e41297256b44","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n$, $\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined in [[27-df-monodnf]], [[27-df-dual]] and [[27-df-piset]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n$, $\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ and $\\mathrm{PI}$ are defined in [[27-df-monodnf]], [[27-df-dual]] and [[27-df-piset]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dual}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{MonotoneDNF}_n\\;\\left(|\\mathrm{PI}(\\mathrm{Dual}_n(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)))|\\le n^{|D|}\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1535,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-472","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-monodualcount|thm-monodualcount — Output bound for positive DNF dualization]]"}],"outgoing":["814b17f1550bcf38","b491e41297256b44","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","753698ebb6dab618","5d10aed668d85817","0b618255959ff4bc"]}